@startuml
title No-Injection Boundary
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

rectangle "Guest source\ntemplate" as Source #FEF3C7
rectangle "Parse once" as Parse #DBEAFE
rectangle "Typed hole\nnode" as Hole #DCFCE7
rectangle "Host value\nas AST" as Value #DCFCE7
rectangle "Category check" as Check #DBEAFE
rectangle "AST graft" as Graft #DCFCE7
rectangle "Final guest\nAST" as Result #DCFCE7
rectangle "Rendered text attack\nclosing delimiter / separator" as Attack #FEE2E2

Source --> Parse : before values are known
Parse --> Hole : creates structural slot
Value --> Check : value is already AST
Check --> Graft : type-compatible only
Hole --> Graft : replace this node only
Graft --> Result : preserve outer tree
Attack -[#DC2626,dashed]-> Graft : rejected\nnever parsed as source

legend right
  |= Color |= Concept |
  |<#FEF3C7> | Guest source template |
  |<#DBEAFE> | Parser / typecheck step |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Typed AST boundary |
  |<#FEE2E2> | Rejected text attack |
endlegend
@enduml
